            <p>Visiting Fire Island National Seashore was an unforgettable escape from the city. From exploring the historic Fire Island Lighthouse to wandering through the rare Sunken Forest, the island offers a perfect blend of untouched nature and coastal charm. Walking along the boardwalks and watching the sunset over the Atlantic Ocean were absolute highlights of the trip.</p>
